    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.25_sheaf_gluing.chapters.01_sheaf_basics_local_sections.sections.01_site_of_mittens_history.concrete_anchor_5#siteofmittenshistory" .
silm:instances_papers_25_sheaf_gluing_chapters_01_sheaf_basics_local_sections_sections_01_site_of_mittens_history_concrete_anchor_5#siteofmittenshistory silm:hasLongDescription "The SiteOfMittensHistory is the small category whose objects are named, typed opens over the Mittens history. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Op(X_Mittens)', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
